{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1521192177,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMDU4NTQ0NzE=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2312","origin":"github"},"title":"Drop bids2scidata dep on pandas?","message":"This desire came up on #2294. I am extracting my statement from that PR for posterity:\n\u003e Anyone who wants to work on removing the pandas dependency in the future should be aware of two things. ISATAB requires a particular substructure of its tables that involved a certain set of columns (with identical names occurring multiple times in the same document). ATM these columns are injected late in the process, and documents are merged. Any alternative implementation will either need to provide such features, or require a substantial rewrite of this command.","files":null}]}